{"exercise_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S233-EXERCISE-233YD","hint_ordinal":4,"id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S233-HINT-233YD-04","provenance":{"basis":"active Hint macro associated with 233Yd","kind":"source-derived-hint-map"},"record_type":"hint","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","segment_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S233-SEG-233YD","semantic_anchor":"233Yd","source_anchor":"233Yd","source_line_start":774,"source_raw_tex_sha256":"73c208953e9df63e62c19eb901d1526f6afc5039d2f4e1aba40ade60b007403c","source_text":"show that $\\{x:f(x)\\le 0\\}$ is dense in $[0,1]$,\r\nuse (ii) to show that it is conegligible in $[0,1]$ and apply (iii).","target_line_start":800,"target_raw_tex_sha256":"87d0baec3512a288fcdc90337aa832526c6e649977490776fe7c60f40411b77f","target_text":"tunjukkan bahwa $\\{x:f(x)\\le 0\\}$ padat dalam $[0,1]$, gunakan\n(ii) untuk menunjukkan bahwa himpunan tersebut koterabaikan dalam\n$[0,1]$, lalu terapkan (iii).","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S233"}
{"exercise_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S233-EXERCISE-233YF","hint_ordinal":1,"id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S233-HINT-233YF-01","provenance":{"basis":"active Hint macro associated with 233Yf","kind":"source-derived-hint-map"},"record_type":"hint","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","segment_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S233-SEG-233YF","semantic_anchor":"233Yf","source_anchor":"233Yf","source_line_start":789,"source_raw_tex_sha256":"a79c2806afd6479d70f1fd9a755c5cbc145d744f50d8d2ff7039c3a724491533","source_text":"if $r=2$, identify $\\BbbR^2$ with $\\Bbb C$;  reduce to the case in\r\nwhich $C$ contains no points which are real and negative;  set\r\n$\\theta=\\sup\\{\\arg z:z\\in C\\}$ and $b=-ie^{i\\theta}$.   Now induce on $r$.","target_line_start":820,"target_raw_tex_sha256":"e6152467c45aeab7546ade80d23615004b640e53a36e18627d9b2ae13d620950","target_text":"jika $r=2$, identifikasikan $\\BbbR^2$ dengan $\\Bbb C$; reduksikan\nke kasus ketika $C$ tidak memuat titik yang real dan negatif; tetapkan\n$\\theta=\\sup\\{\\arg z:z\\in C\\}$ dan $b=-ie^{i\\theta}$. Lalu gunakan\ninduksi pada $r$.","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S233"}
{"exercise_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S233-EXERCISE-233YG","hint_ordinal":1,"id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S233-HINT-233YG-01","provenance":{"basis":"active Hint macro associated with 233Yg","kind":"source-derived-hint-map"},"record_type":"hint","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","segment_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S233-SEG-233YG","semantic_anchor":"233Yg","source_anchor":"233Yg","source_line_start":798,"source_raw_tex_sha256":"9e77170f0390705e1537e70dac3dc5a027d89f2bee3cc79671fbdff147d98f8a","source_text":"try $h(y)=\\inf\\{\\phi(z)-\\varinnerprod{z}{y}:z\\in C\\}$, and apply\r\n233Yf to a translate of $\\{(z,t):\\phi(z)\\le t\\}$.","target_line_start":831,"target_raw_tex_sha256":"5c1fbbae5632eb5502e2a505fcc0e91d1b57053e1144b0b924383f31365ac8f7","target_text":"coba $h(y)=\\inf\\{\\phi(z)-\\varinnerprod{z}{y}:z\\in C\\}$, lalu\nterapkan 233Yf pada suatu translasi dari\n$\\{(z,t):\\phi(z)\\le t\\}$.","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S233"}
