{"exercise_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S233-EXERCISE-233YJ","hint_ordinal":1,"id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S233-HINT-233YJ-01","provenance":{"basis":"active Hint macro associated with 233Yj","kind":"source-derived-hint-map"},"record_type":"hint","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","segment_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S233-SEG-233YJ","semantic_anchor":"233Yj","source_anchor":"233Yj","source_line_start":828,"source_raw_tex_sha256":"103e60c7f97e8c9b08e5e9894c766eb424d41cd99b8db170fc6a04ab66bf2dc8","source_text":"putting 215B(viii) and 235K below together, show that there are a\r\nprobability measure $\\nu$ on $X$ and a function $h:X\\to\\coint{0,\\infty}$\r\nsuch that $\\int f_jd\\mu=\\int f_j\\times h\\,d\\nu$ for every $j$.","target_line_start":867,"target_raw_tex_sha256":"4a9c6b301a199362b8e1176ada9f49288a964b6a1d38386689eafe704bbd4d3a","target_text":"dengan menggabungkan 215B(viii) dan 235K di bawah, tunjukkan bahwa\nterdapat suatu ukuran probabilitas $\\nu$ pada $X$ dan suatu fungsi\n$h:X\\to\\coint{0,\\infty}$ sedemikian sehingga\n$\\int f_jd\\mu=\\int f_j\\times h\\,d\\nu$ untuk setiap $j$.","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S233"}
